1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:01,330
(Sheldon:)As if one of the plants

2
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:03,100
from
Invasion of the Body Snatchers

3
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:04,860
(Sheldon:)duplicated you in every way,

4
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:07,630
(Sheldon:)only with an absurd
amount of hair gel.

5
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,040
(Sheldon:)What are you
working on?

6
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,950
(Sheldon:)I'm removing
my digital footprint

7
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,110
(Sheldon:)from the Internet

8
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:15,060
(Sheldon:)so Amy Farrah Fowler
can't find me

9
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,730
(Sheldon:)and compel me to meet her mother.
Ah.

10
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:19,140
(Leonard:)You're going off the grid.

11
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:20,210
(Sheldon:)Exactly.

12
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:23,520
(Leonard:)The old Unabomber approach.
Kudos.

13
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,820
(Leonard:)Thank you.

14
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:28,240
(Sheldon:)I've also sent Amy a
relationship termination notice

15
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:31,990
(Sheldon:)and changed my cell phone number
and e-mail address.

16
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:33,740
(Leonard:)What if she just comes over?

17
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:34,740
(Sheldon:)She'll get lost.

18
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:37,550
(Sheldon:)We no longer live
at 2311 Los Robles.

19
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:42,640
(Sheldon:)We now live at 311 Los Robles.

20
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:47,090
(Leonard:)You changed the address
on the building?

21
00:00:47,090 --> 00:00:48,240
(Leonard:)What about mail?

22
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:50,260
(Sheldon:)Oh, no worries--
I explained my predicament

23
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:51,410
(Sheldon:)to our letter carrier.

24
00:00:51,410 --> 00:00:52,460
(Sheldon:)He was sympathetic.

25
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,760
His exact words were:

26
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,130
"Got your back, Jack.

27
00:00:55,130 --> 00:01:03,020
Bitches be crazy."

